# Shuttlecraft Galileo: "6+ | Flying / Whenever Shuttlecraft Galileo attacks, up to seven target attacking creatures gain
# flying until end of turn." The attack trigger is part of the 6+ striation (CR 721.2a), so Galileo has it only with six or
# more charge counters. With none, March of the Machines makes it a 4/4 artifact creature (its mana value), and it attacks
# on turn 3: nothing triggers, and it has no flying.

